			description: ["Every weapon in Aldreth belongs to a class, and every class plays differently: speed, reach, stagger, sweep, windup. Combat has weight and direction: the sword you pick tells the world who you are.", "Find an example of each class and see how it feels. Your skill tree rewards sticking to a class, so play with a few before you commit."]
